usage: prepare_execution.py [-h] --mode {prepare,seal,check} --admission-sha
                            ADMISSION_SHA [--qa-sha QA_SHA]
                            [--tests-receipt TESTS_RECEIPT]
                            [--integrity-sha INTEGRITY_SHA]

Prepare/seal metadata-only execution v2 without modifying frozen science. No
preparation or remote action occurs on import. All writes are exclusive in new
versioned directories, and the original absolute host deadlines remain fixed.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --mode {prepare,seal,check}
  --admission-sha ADMISSION_SHA
  --qa-sha QA_SHA
  --tests-receipt TESTS_RECEIPT
  --integrity-sha INTEGRITY_SHA
